WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.750
- [Narrator:] Chef Russell Wilson took over the Bronco last year...

00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:05.500
And it quickly fell on hard times.

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:09.000
But now they're calling in the one guy
who may be able to save it.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.125
- This is the worst run restaurant
in the history of restaurants.

00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:15.625
- Are you always this mean
or is it just for the cameras?

00:00:18.791 --> 00:00:21.666
- What's the most important part
of running a successful restaurant?

00:00:21.666 --> 00:00:23.041
- That everyone likes me.

00:00:23.041 --> 00:00:24.250
- What? No?

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.041
- I work front of house, so I have to defend whatever Russ serves up.  

00:00:27.041 --> 00:00:30.416
Lots of scrambles, the occasional duck, and a bunch of turnovers lately.

00:00:30.791 --> 00:00:32.750
- You know,
my job is to run the plates to the tables,

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.625
but a lot of times
Russ just fakes the hand off.

00:00:35.291 --> 00:00:36.375
- I'll just do it myself.

00:00:38.791 --> 00:00:39.625
What’ll you have?

00:00:39.625 --> 00:00:41.500
Our menu is unlimited.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.000
- Menus need limits.

00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:44.791
This is no way to run a business.

00:00:44.791 --> 00:00:47.750
Between you and me,
the competition on the AFC Westside

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.541
isn't as intense as you think.

00:00:49.541 --> 00:00:51.875
[Payton:] The Chargers
basically run a social media restaurant,

00:00:51.875 --> 00:00:54.125
but it turns out ultimately,
they don't even deliver.

00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:56.416
- Hope you left room for dessert, my dudes!

00:00:56.416 --> 00:00:58.041
- Oh, god! It burns! Ahh!

00:00:58.041 --> 00:00:58.916
- My leg!

00:00:58.916 --> 00:01:00.500
- Why does this keep happening?

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.416
- [Payton:] The Raiders just hope
everyone gets distracted by the show.

00:01:03.416 --> 00:01:05.791
- Excuse me. This is... not good. 

00:01:05.791 --> 00:01:07.000
- Yeah, that is correct.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.000
- [Payton:] And with all the rumors, no one 
can even get into the Chiefs restaurant.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.750
- [Paparazzi:] Travis? Travis,
are you meeting Taylor Swift inside?

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.250
- Ugh, why is everyone making a big deal about this 
thing I bring up all the time! 

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:21.125
I mean, yes we won it for you, but it was also just the Bears.

00:01:21.666 --> 00:01:23.125
- We made some big changes.

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:26.166
Russ finally listened to me
and agreed to wear a recipe wristband.

00:01:26.166 --> 00:01:27.750
- But, it's so heavy.

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:28.916
- SERVICE TIME, CHEFS!

00:01:28.916 --> 00:01:30.000
ALL HANDS ON DECK!

